  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökikuwalwal kegh pipö Israel ompö kanasyanta Mispa lö, “Möminye chi nyo le ompö akonga ompö acha nyo yilchini cheptanyi pipö ara Penchamen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa pïchay pö Israel Petel akumpur tawu Tororöt ompö atoni ntökwimön, kuteghyö akïriryö ompö ngwonïn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akïlö, “Heywey, ECHOTYON, Tororöt pö Israel! Kölö ne tökwigha kïgh nyo lata nyï ompö koro Israel, ntökwanyï ye kamach kuwonyö pipö ara Penchamen ompö Israel?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini le kiwasan, kïtek pïchay ato kïpelo amöros akutöteghö amörostin cho kïpelöy nko ropöwo kalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep kegh pïchay pö Israel lö, “Ngo ompö ortïna Israel löwïr nyo melö kengwïn tuyonï mi tawu ECHOTYON?” Ompöwölo kökikuwalwal kegh chane lö chi anka tïkwïl nyo mötuyeghonye tawu ECHOTYON ompö Mispa kepöröy nyinte nyo mötïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusyonchï pipö Israel werkökwa pipö Penchamen akïlö, “Kewonyö or akonga asisete ompö pipö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kighecha ne töketönö kor pipö Penchamen cho köngötï? Akwanyï kikiwolwolchicha ECHOTYON lö melö tökeyilchinecha chane tipicho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïmak chane kunkïtï lö ekï ngo ompö pipö Israel cho melö kipa kïtuyeghö wölnö le Mispa, kunkïtï lö möminye chi nyo le ompö akonga nyo kingwïna pipö Yapes Kiliad ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo otini kikiyit pich, ki puryö chi nyo le ompö akonga nyo le nyingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona keyonta pich cho le 12,000 cho kile nyökon kïpa wölini, akïmwochï lö, “Ape apara chi anka tïkwïl nyo mi Yapes kïmi nko kor nko monïng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apar chi nyo le mïrön nko työ anka tïkwïl nyo kirï nko mïrön.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kitïta Yapes Kiliad kïnyorchï wöloni chepkïltïtin cho le 400, kumït chane kïpa möngot nyo kimi Syilo koro Kanan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïyonta tuyonay kïmïkul kut wölo mi pipö Penchamen cho kimi ghatya Rimon tökïmwochï chane lö kikyam mis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïlonchö nyu pipö Penchamen, kutö pïchay pö Israel chane tipichay kikïsörunö Yapes Kiliad, wölo melö kimïchï chane tipichoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusyonchï chane pipö Penchamen ompöwölo kikupesyö ECHOTYON chane ompö pipö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïlö poyichay pö tuyonay, “Kighöy ne tökïnyorï pïchï kor köngötï akwanyï kikuwonyö korï ompö koro pipö Penchamen? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo mïchini keyar or nyo kitokuno pipö Penchamen cho köngötï, atö mewonyö or akong ompö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo melö kimukecha keyilchine chane tipicho.” Ompöwölo kiwalwal pipö Israel lö, “Chïpote chi anka tïkwïl nyo yilchini pipö Penchamen monïng.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlö, “Mito osiswö cho kighchini ichon ECHOTYON ompö köny anka tïkwïl ompö Syilo nyo mi okumpö ewu löt nyo pö Petel okumpö kongasispa aranay pö mït wegho Petel kutöngöy Syekem, okumpö tagh nyo pö Lepona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï nyu pipö Penchamen lö, “Ape aghïpcheghö pareni sapipun asyepisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kasïwekwa tipïn cho pkono Syilo atö kïpironchö atoni kyomöy ichon, apkana parenichoni pö sapipun, aichït chi anka tïkwïl korkengu ompö tipichoni apa nko chane koro Penchamen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato pka papotïnekwa anta werkökwa lö kirwokinokwa, olenchï, ‘Kaykay opïswecha ketïpinö nko chane, ompöwölo melö kikïpörunecha chane poryot kïlïkwï korucha amelö kyokonechakwa chane, nyo möle otïngetekwa lelut nyonikïny.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh lenyoni pïchay pö Penchamen, kuchïtyï kegh korukwa cho tenö chane, ompö tipichoni kipka kïpironchö, kwip akïpechï kegh kutang korengwa. Kïtek kanastinekwa ngat akïmöngisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpegha atoni pipö Israel akïpa wölo mi piko arengwa nko kaporkökwa ompö koroswekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
